# Finance reference workbooks and any spreadsheet drop. The Aging Balance reference
# workbook carries real client names and receivable amounts (the supplied "anonymized"
# copy still listed the top-10 clients on its Graphiques tab), and this repository is
# PUBLIC. Only structure-only fixtures under tests/fixtures/ may be committed —
# tests/fin-aging-engine.test.ts fails if business data appears in one.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls

# Local editor MCP config and business documents — never in a public repo
.vscode/mcp.json
*.docx
*.pptx
docs/Logistic Pack/

# MAYA legacy migration artifacts. The MAYA analysis workspace lives OUTSIDE this
# repository (C:\Projects\MAYA Analysis) and nothing from it belongs here: these are
# WINDEV/HFSQL program, data and connection formats carrying real client, dossier and
# credential material, and this repository is PUBLIC. Extension-scoped on purpose —
# a blanket rule would hide legitimate sources elsewhere in the tree. Only synthetic
# structure-only fixtures under tests/fixtures/ may ever be committed.
*.wx
*.WX
*.wdd
*.WDD
*.wdk
*.WDK
*.fic
*.FIC
*.ndx
*.NDX
*.mmo
*.MMO
*.dpl
